# DEV FrameSpec target interface; algebra and native refinement remain distinct.
direction: down
Scheme: "Scheme semantic liveness + saved registers"
Encode: "FL-ENCODE / FL-INTERNAL\nBounded kind, cfs, F and root-map encoding"
Bind: "FL-BIND / FL-MAP\nResolved OFD + streaming/random bit contract"
Coords: "FL-COORD / FL-UPDATE\nStack B[-i] <-> Heap H[F+1-i]\nControl rewrites and copy custody explicit"
Roots: "FL-COVERAGE / FL-WRITERS\nData + return + control + foreign roots"
T0: "FL-HANDOFF / FL-T0\nTarget execution / participant / GC worker split"
Existing: "Existing models/ QNT + Lean bindings\nScoped support, unchanged"
Ascent: "ASCENT source-law-target-cut-counterexample joins\nHypotheses, no native admission"
Scheme -> Encode
Encode -> Bind
Bind -> Coords
Coords -> Roots
Roots -> T0
Existing -> T0: "reuse by contract ID"
Encode -> Ascent
Roots -> Ascent
T0 -> Ascent
